WEBVTT

00:42.000 --> 00:44.419
FRACTAL GEOMETRY

00:44.502 --> 00:46.671
EVERYTHING ABOUT SACRED GEOMETRY

00:46.755 --> 00:48.673
AUDI AND BMW
3D GEOMETRY

00:55.805 --> 00:57.640
What a shitty brother.

00:58.725 --> 00:59.559
Crap!

01:02.687 --> 01:03.605
Shit.

01:04.522 --> 01:06.483
Skipped your interview again?

01:10.153 --> 01:13.573
After I begged them to consider you,
you're playing games?

01:16.117 --> 01:18.119
Did I ever tell you to do that?

01:19.537 --> 01:21.623
Dad also said
this is the last time he's helping.

01:22.916 --> 01:24.876
He won't help you
look for jobs anymore.

01:26.127 --> 01:28.463
I'm saying
that I never asked for your help.

01:28.546 --> 01:29.923
But you needed it.

01:30.924 --> 01:32.509
You're just a parasite at home.

01:36.054 --> 01:38.556
Okay, I'm leaving then.

01:39.474 --> 01:41.851
If only we could reset reality.

01:44.854 --> 01:46.981
It was way better
when Mom was still alive.

02:04.040 --> 02:05.250
Ryohei.

02:06.376 --> 02:08.878
Just don't get in your brother's way.

02:16.427 --> 02:18.304
ARISU RESIDENCE

02:33.903 --> 02:37.323
CHOTA SEGAWA, DAIKICHI KARUBE

02:38.408 --> 02:40.326
ARISU: CAN I GO TO THE BAR?

02:44.247 --> 02:46.332
ARISU: I'M OFFICIALLY HOMELESS

03:11.316 --> 03:12.525
Oh, boss.

03:12.609 --> 03:14.277
- Good day.
- You're early, Karube.

03:16.029 --> 03:17.864
I just happened to come in early.

03:17.947 --> 03:19.699
Why are you here at this time of the day?

03:19.782 --> 03:21.534
I have some business to attend to.

03:27.457 --> 03:30.001
ARISU: KARUBE, YOU THERE?

03:31.002 --> 03:34.464
KARUBE

03:34.547 --> 03:36.674
How dare you put your hands on my woman!

03:36.758 --> 03:37.800
- Fuck you!
- Stop it!

03:38.551 --> 03:40.094
Shove it, woman!

03:45.225 --> 03:46.768
I feel better now.

03:58.863 --> 04:05.787
ARISU:
CHOTA, YOU WORKING? LET ME STAY OVER

04:06.579 --> 04:11.459
CHOTA

04:21.219 --> 04:22.136
Here, Mom.

04:24.222 --> 04:26.599
I'm sorry that you have to do this
when you're so busy, Chota.

04:27.350 --> 04:29.560
This will keep me going.

04:29.644 --> 04:31.562
Let's make this the last time, okay?

04:33.439 --> 04:35.358
How can this be the last time?

04:36.776 --> 04:40.738
ARISU: HEY, ARE YOU IGNORING ME?

04:41.322 --> 04:43.116
Even the air in Tokyo…

04:43.199 --> 04:45.994
It has been contaminated
by the evilness of mankind.

04:46.995 --> 04:48.997
We need to purify it!

04:49.080 --> 04:52.000
Here, here, and here.
Everything has to be purified!

04:52.083 --> 04:53.710
I got it already!

04:55.295 --> 04:56.337
See you.

04:56.963 --> 04:57.839
Thank you!

05:03.303 --> 05:04.887
ARISU: FINE

05:20.737 --> 05:24.657
KARUBE: I WAS FIRED FROM MY JOB

05:28.202 --> 05:30.580
Karube has such bad timing!

05:31.998 --> 05:33.458
ARISU: SERIOUSLY? WHEN?

05:33.541 --> 05:37.712
KARUBE:
RIGHT NOW. I'M JOBLESS NOW!

05:37.795 --> 05:40.631
ARISU: SERIOUSLY? WHEN?
KARUBE: RIGHT NOW. I'M JOBLESS NOW!

05:40.757 --> 05:46.763
CHOTA: GOOD JOB GETTING FIRED
I'M SKIPPING WORK RIGHT NOW

05:48.097 --> 05:52.018
KARUBE:
YOU SHOULD WORK, CHOTA. YOU ARE POOR

05:54.354 --> 05:56.481
ARISU: I LEFT HOME

05:57.648 --> 05:59.359
CHOTA: GOOD WORK

05:59.442 --> 06:01.361
ARISU: I NEED A DRINK

06:01.444 --> 06:02.987
CHOTA: ME TOO!

06:03.071 --> 06:04.947
KARUBE: LET'S GO THEN!

06:05.031 --> 06:07.950
ARISU: GO FIND A JOB, KARUBE.

06:08.034 --> 06:09.619
CHOTA: YOU TOO, ARISU.

06:11.120 --> 06:14.707
KARUBE: OKAY,
LET'S MEET IN FRONT OF SHIBUYA STATION

06:14.791 --> 06:16.626
ARISU: OKAY!

06:16.709 --> 06:17.543
ARISU: OKAY!

06:21.506 --> 06:23.549
ARISU: I STEPPED ON SOMEONE'S VOMIT

06:23.633 --> 06:26.094
CHOTA: GOOD JOB STEPPING ON VOMIT

06:41.442 --> 06:44.612
ARISU: I'M HAVING THE WORST DAY

06:45.613 --> 06:46.864
CHOTA: ME TOO

06:46.948 --> 06:48.574
KARUBE: SAME

06:48.658 --> 06:54.664
ARISU: I JUST DON'T FEEL LIKE
I'M DOING MY BEST SINCE THIS MORNING

06:56.541 --> 06:59.544
KARUBE: ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT YOUR GAME?

07:03.256 --> 07:06.217
ARISU: FOUND YOU, KARUBE!

07:08.052 --> 07:10.346
KARUBE: HEY!

07:10.430 --> 07:12.140
CHOTA: HEY!

07:12.223 --> 07:14.725
ARISU: HEY!

07:16.227 --> 07:17.478
Just talk.

07:18.813 --> 07:20.356
So where to?

07:20.940 --> 07:23.109
There are only a few pubs open, right?

07:23.192 --> 07:24.444
Man.

07:25.820 --> 07:28.156
We're all chased out with nowhere to go.

07:32.452 --> 07:34.120
Oh, well.

07:34.203 --> 07:36.706
Wish I could go to some unknown place.

07:40.918 --> 07:43.713
It would be bad if zombies
were to appear in Shibuya, huh?

07:43.796 --> 07:46.215
If they're all bitten here,
they will all turn into zombies!

07:46.299 --> 07:48.885
Stop it with the zombie talk
and think about which shop to go to.

07:48.968 --> 07:52.096
But if zombies were to appear,
I guess only Karube would survive.

07:52.180 --> 07:54.515
You'd knock those zombies out
with one punch.

07:54.599 --> 07:56.058
No, it wouldn't be me.

07:56.142 --> 07:57.852
You'd be the one to survive, Arisu.

07:57.935 --> 07:59.437
Me? Why?

08:00.897 --> 08:03.065
I'm sure you're the one who will survive.

08:06.861 --> 08:09.655
Arisu, you know…

08:11.532 --> 08:14.577
Stop hanging out with us
and go live a normal life.

08:16.370 --> 08:17.622
You can do it.

08:19.499 --> 08:20.374
What?

08:21.167 --> 08:22.335
What's with that?

09:15.888 --> 09:17.014
All right.

09:17.557 --> 09:18.391
Here we go.

09:19.433 --> 09:20.893
- What are you doing?
- Hey!

09:20.977 --> 09:22.937
This is your Independence Day!

09:23.020 --> 09:24.063
Let's take a photo!

09:24.146 --> 09:25.189
Okay!

09:26.023 --> 09:27.692
Passing through!

09:27.775 --> 09:28.943
Move aside!

09:29.026 --> 09:31.779
- Move aside!
- Hey, this is dangerous!

09:31.862 --> 09:34.615
- Hey!
- Come on, let's take a photo!

09:35.366 --> 09:36.200
We're here!

09:36.284 --> 09:37.827
Hey, what are you doing?

09:37.910 --> 09:38.828
Take a photo!

09:38.911 --> 09:40.788
Hey, don't take my picture!

09:40.871 --> 09:43.165
Here, Arisu! Look over here!

09:43.249 --> 09:45.042
Come on, Arisu!

09:45.126 --> 09:46.752
- Here!
- Smile!

09:46.836 --> 09:49.171
Stop it already!

09:50.214 --> 09:51.841
That's a good expression!

10:07.982 --> 10:09.692
This is nice!

10:11.652 --> 10:12.862
Great!

10:19.577 --> 10:21.203
Shibuya!

10:22.204 --> 10:23.748
You're the best!

10:31.172 --> 10:33.132
- Hey!
- Oh, shit!

10:35.259 --> 10:37.678
- Yikes!
- That was close!

10:38.929 --> 10:40.097
- Hurry up!
- Look, fireworks!

10:40.765 --> 10:42.224
Run for your lives!

10:49.231 --> 10:52.193
It's the police! This is bad!

10:52.276 --> 10:53.319
Let's run for it!

10:55.154 --> 10:55.988
Where to now?

11:04.497 --> 11:05.456
Over there!

11:07.249 --> 11:08.751
Police!

11:08.834 --> 11:10.628
Head for the restroom!

11:11.587 --> 11:12.546
Sorry!

11:17.009 --> 11:20.429
Hurry!

11:20.513 --> 11:22.932
- Just hurry up already!
- Hurry up!

11:38.864 --> 11:40.741
CHOTA: WHO FARTED?

11:46.706 --> 11:49.458
CHOTA: WHO WAS IT? OWN UP
AND SNIFF UP YOUR OWN FART!

11:51.627 --> 11:54.422
It was you, right?

12:14.734 --> 12:15.860
Power outage.

12:32.376 --> 12:33.627
I'll go out and check.

12:35.296 --> 12:36.464
Be careful.

15:29.929 --> 15:30.763
What?

17:17.745 --> 17:18.662
Emi.

17:24.626 --> 17:25.586
Emi!

17:39.767 --> 17:43.687
WHERE'S THAT FILE?!
GET YOUR ACT TOGETHER! - TAKAGI

19:15.112 --> 19:16.613
Are you serious…

19:45.767 --> 19:47.144
Hey!

19:50.314 --> 19:51.690
Hello?

19:57.154 --> 19:58.572
Anyone here?

20:06.246 --> 20:07.539
Hello?

20:32.231 --> 20:33.440
Did you find anyone?

20:33.523 --> 20:34.483
No.

20:36.068 --> 20:37.110
How was it?

20:37.736 --> 20:39.196
There's no one around at all.

20:45.369 --> 20:47.746
Even our cellphones aren't working.

21:01.468 --> 21:03.595
Could it be an evacuation drill?

21:06.014 --> 21:07.015
What's that?

21:09.184 --> 21:12.354
An event? A flash mob, maybe?

21:13.397 --> 21:15.023
The scale is too huge for that.

21:19.361 --> 21:21.738
If only the three of us remain here…

21:39.131 --> 21:40.590
This doesn't seem so bad to me.

21:42.175 --> 21:43.093
What?

21:44.761 --> 21:46.179
Don't you find this exciting?

21:48.473 --> 21:49.599
Are you insane?

21:51.977 --> 21:54.313
You're right. I think this is quite nice.

21:54.396 --> 21:55.272
Hey.

21:55.897 --> 21:57.858
I don't have to go to work.

21:59.651 --> 22:01.069
Have you guys gone crazy?

22:01.153 --> 22:03.071
No one would be angry at us.

22:03.155 --> 22:05.407
And we can eat and drink
all we want, right?

22:07.701 --> 22:09.286
You'll be a virgin your entire life.

22:10.746 --> 22:12.414
I don't want that.

22:27.179 --> 22:29.848
All right!

22:29.931 --> 22:30.766
All right.

22:36.313 --> 22:39.024
- Isn't this nice?
- Perfect!

22:39.107 --> 22:41.068
- Hey.
- Arisu!

22:41.151 --> 22:42.861
Stop joking around, you guys!

22:42.944 --> 22:44.154
Karube!

22:45.614 --> 22:47.741
- It hurts!
- Come on, say that it's nice!

22:52.454 --> 22:53.413
Look.

23:00.629 --> 23:04.800
WELCOME, PLAYERS
THE GAME WILL COMMENCE IN A MOMENT

23:07.844 --> 23:10.555
WELCOME, PLAYERS.
THE GAME WILL COMMENCE IN A MOMENT

23:10.639 --> 23:11.598
Game?

23:19.356 --> 23:21.358
THIS WAY TO THE GAME ARENA

23:24.736 --> 23:25.570
Over there.

23:28.115 --> 23:29.324
There are lights.

23:29.908 --> 23:31.076
Is someone there?

23:33.703 --> 23:34.830
Let's go.

23:34.913 --> 23:35.789
Okay.

23:57.352 --> 24:00.605
GM BUILDING

24:31.803 --> 24:37.350
THE GAME ARENA IS UP AHEAD

25:36.868 --> 25:39.704
ONE PER PERSON

26:18.201 --> 26:21.037
FACE RECOGNITION IN PROGRESS
PLEASE WAIT A MOMENT

26:21.955 --> 26:23.164
It has facial recognition.

26:23.873 --> 26:25.125
Can we use these phones?

26:27.544 --> 26:28.878
There's no signal.

26:29.504 --> 26:30.922
We can't make calls with this.

26:32.966 --> 26:35.176
Please wait for the game to commence.

26:36.136 --> 26:39.389
Two minutes until registration closes.

26:40.181 --> 26:42.559
There are currently three participants.

26:43.226 --> 26:44.561
What's this?

26:46.062 --> 26:47.188
A game.

26:49.357 --> 26:51.026
There's a human.

26:51.651 --> 26:52.569
Hey.

26:52.652 --> 26:54.112
Do you know where everyone went?

27:11.379 --> 27:12.881
What was that just now?

27:13.673 --> 27:14.507
A laser?

27:14.591 --> 27:15.634
CONNECT LIGHT
CHOTA SEGAWA

27:15.717 --> 27:19.095
Once you cross the borderline,
you can never return.

27:19.804 --> 27:21.806
You have no choice
but to participate in the game.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.368
It might be best not to go any further.

27:48.583 --> 27:50.251
I'm so relieved!

27:51.044 --> 27:53.004
Geez, I thought
I wouldn't find anyone here!

27:57.092 --> 27:58.593
My condolences.

28:07.310 --> 28:08.937
Registration has closed.

28:09.646 --> 28:11.064
The game will now commence.

28:12.273 --> 28:13.274
Game?

28:14.484 --> 28:16.611
Game, "Dead or Alive."

28:16.695 --> 28:17.779
DEAD OR ALIVE

28:17.862 --> 28:20.365
Difficulty, Three of Clubs

28:20.448 --> 28:22.200
Three of Clubs?

28:22.784 --> 28:23.868
What does that mean?

28:24.744 --> 28:26.204
Rule.

28:26.287 --> 28:30.125
Select the correct door
within the stipulated time.

28:30.917 --> 28:31.751
What?

28:32.252 --> 28:33.253
Clear condition.

28:33.336 --> 28:36.256
Leave the building within the time limit.

28:39.551 --> 28:43.430
START

28:47.100 --> 28:48.810
You'll die if you keep spacing out.

28:58.486 --> 28:59.320
There's no time.

29:20.884 --> 29:24.179
The time limit for this room
is two minutes.

29:42.530 --> 29:43.406
What's this?

29:50.455 --> 29:51.289
LIVE

29:51.372 --> 29:52.624
To live…

29:52.707 --> 29:53.541
DIE

29:53.625 --> 29:54.626
…or to die.

29:56.628 --> 29:59.047
Is this really a game?

30:00.298 --> 30:04.219
This is kind of starting
to get a little exciting.

30:08.556 --> 30:11.100
I'm sure this must be some kind of event.

30:12.852 --> 30:15.939
I want to go home.

30:17.482 --> 30:19.317
It'll be fine. You're with us!

30:19.400 --> 30:21.569
Let's win the game,
get the prize, and go home.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.655
The prize?

30:24.572 --> 30:26.074
I was hoping that we'd get one.

30:26.157 --> 30:27.617
One minute remaining.

30:27.700 --> 30:28.618
Arisu.

30:29.410 --> 30:30.954
Which do you think it is?

30:31.037 --> 30:31.955
Well…

30:33.164 --> 30:35.875
If it's a choice between life and death,

30:35.959 --> 30:37.961
I wouldn't choose the skeleton.

30:40.213 --> 30:41.589
What if we choose the wrong door?

30:42.799 --> 30:43.925
The answer is "Live."

30:44.676 --> 30:46.135
Open the door that says "Live."

30:47.387 --> 30:48.221
How do you know that?

30:48.805 --> 30:51.266
Because obviously, it's the "Live" door!

30:54.686 --> 30:55.770
Do you guys smell something?

30:57.480 --> 30:58.523
Hey, look down!

31:00.567 --> 31:01.484
Fire?

31:02.819 --> 31:04.112
Thirty seconds remaining.

31:04.195 --> 31:05.530
The answer is "Live"!

31:05.613 --> 31:07.532
- Hurry up and open the door!
- Open it yourself!

31:07.615 --> 31:09.284
What will happen if the time is up?

31:09.367 --> 31:10.994
We have no time. Hurry up!

31:11.077 --> 31:14.789
- Why do you think that's the answer?
- Clearly, we can't choose to die, can we?

31:14.873 --> 31:16.165
Twenty seconds remaining.

31:16.249 --> 31:17.584
I can't stand it anymore!

31:28.720 --> 31:31.472
Did she die?

31:33.892 --> 31:34.767
Ten seconds remaining.

31:37.312 --> 31:39.188
DIE

31:39.939 --> 31:42.692
Five. Four. Three.

31:42.775 --> 31:44.277
- Chota!
- Two. One.

31:44.903 --> 31:46.279
Quick!

31:48.072 --> 31:50.116
The time limit for this room

31:50.199 --> 31:51.993
is one minute and fifty seconds.

31:57.457 --> 31:58.958
She really died.

31:59.042 --> 32:00.335
What the hell is this?

32:01.920 --> 32:04.047
You were the one who killed that girl.

32:04.130 --> 32:05.965
But we survived because of me, right?

32:06.633 --> 32:07.467
What?

32:07.550 --> 32:08.384
Go on. Hit me.

32:08.927 --> 32:11.137
If you guys keep spacing out,
you'll die too.

32:12.972 --> 32:14.015
Damn it!

32:15.308 --> 32:16.976
Do we choose "Die" here, too?

32:18.061 --> 32:20.605
Since the last one was "Die,"
the next one should be "Live."

32:21.105 --> 32:23.358
Yes. It can't be "Die" twice in a row.

32:23.441 --> 32:26.027
- But it's hard to choose "Die."
- I see.

32:26.110 --> 32:28.488
I'm sure that this is a game for us
to choose a sacrifice

32:28.571 --> 32:29.697
within the time limit.

32:29.781 --> 32:30.657
Sacrifice?

32:30.740 --> 32:32.742
There's probably no meaning to the doors.

32:32.825 --> 32:34.494
What's important is
who's going to open it.

32:34.577 --> 32:36.955
They're telling us to choose one person
within the time limit.

32:37.705 --> 32:39.374
You sacrificed that girl just now.

32:39.999 --> 32:41.626
Why don't you open the door next?

32:41.709 --> 32:44.504
I believe if I were to survive,
it'll be for the good of all mankind.

32:44.587 --> 32:46.381
Don't you feel bad talking about that?

32:48.341 --> 32:49.550
One minute remaining.

32:53.304 --> 32:55.056
No one's going to open the doors
at this rate.

32:55.139 --> 32:57.350
Everyone's going to die
from the fire when the time is up!

32:57.433 --> 32:58.893
Then why don't you open it?

32:59.978 --> 33:01.813
Why ask someone to open it?
Do it yourself!

33:01.896 --> 33:03.439
You also want to let someone else do it!

33:11.364 --> 33:12.407
I'll open it.

33:16.244 --> 33:17.078
Arisu!

33:17.745 --> 33:18.830
LIVE

33:19.956 --> 33:21.249
DIE

33:23.584 --> 33:25.503
Stop, Arisu. Don't be provoked by her!

33:27.588 --> 33:29.007
I'll open the door, damn it!

33:39.726 --> 33:41.102
Thirty seconds remaining.

33:48.568 --> 33:49.485
Arisu!

34:01.456 --> 34:02.290
See?

34:02.373 --> 34:06.294
You can't open it.
Even you would have sacrificed that girl!

34:06.377 --> 34:07.628
Shut the hell up!

34:08.129 --> 34:09.505
Twenty seconds remaining.

34:10.631 --> 34:12.300
I'll do it.

34:12.383 --> 34:13.885
He's got bad luck anyway.

34:13.968 --> 34:16.137
- Karube!
- But we'll take turns!

34:19.182 --> 34:20.433
You'll be next after me.

34:21.350 --> 34:22.685
Ten seconds remaining.

34:23.311 --> 34:24.145
Karube.

34:28.441 --> 34:29.567
Karube!

34:31.861 --> 34:34.947
- Five, Four. Three.
- Karube!

34:35.031 --> 34:36.657
- Two. One.
- Hurry up!

34:40.661 --> 34:42.663
The time limit for this room

34:42.747 --> 34:44.832
is one minute and forty seconds.

34:46.501 --> 34:49.545
- The time limit is shortening each time.
- I can't do this anymore.

34:49.629 --> 34:50.922
We're taking turns.

34:51.506 --> 34:52.965
You open the door next.

34:55.718 --> 34:57.887
- I'll choose the door to open.
- Wait.

34:58.471 --> 34:59.388
"Live."

35:00.056 --> 35:01.182
Open it!

35:02.600 --> 35:03.476
No.

35:09.190 --> 35:11.275
Do you have any ideas, Arisu?

35:12.068 --> 35:12.902
Ideas?

35:12.985 --> 35:16.072
You always say that there's a solution
in every game, right?

35:16.572 --> 35:18.574
- This isn't a game.
- You must know what to do!

35:18.658 --> 35:21.828
You've always solved
puzzle games that I could never do.

35:21.911 --> 35:24.789
- So do it!
- This is not a game, Karube.

35:25.289 --> 35:26.290
It's all about luck here.

35:26.374 --> 35:28.501
- Think, Arisu!
- One minute remaining.

35:29.836 --> 35:31.420
There might have been a hint somewhere.

35:32.213 --> 35:34.882
First, we went into this building.

35:34.966 --> 35:36.175
Stop it already!

35:36.259 --> 35:38.427
- Then, the elevator took us--
- I can't do this!

35:38.511 --> 35:40.930
Don't give up, Arisu! We can't reset!

35:41.013 --> 35:42.348
It's impossible, I'm telling you!

35:42.431 --> 35:44.559
- I can't do this anymore.
- I'm telling you to think!

35:44.642 --> 35:47.728
I've been working my ass off,
while you were just playing games!

35:47.812 --> 35:49.313
What does that have to do with this?

35:49.397 --> 35:51.816
You only know how to beat people up.
What makes you so big?

35:51.899 --> 35:54.026
Well, I'm sorry about that!

35:54.110 --> 35:55.403
Just stop that!

35:57.155 --> 35:58.656
GM BUILDING

36:03.119 --> 36:04.036
Wait a minute.

36:04.787 --> 36:05.955
What's the matter, Arisu?

36:11.502 --> 36:12.712
Thirty seconds remaining.

36:19.135 --> 36:20.261
BMW 523d.

36:22.054 --> 36:23.264
It was a BMW 523d.

36:24.056 --> 36:25.057
So?

36:29.020 --> 36:30.021
The answer is "Die."

36:30.813 --> 36:32.732
- How do you know that?
- Ten seconds remaining.

36:32.815 --> 36:33.774
There's no time!

36:34.442 --> 36:35.610
I'll open the door.

36:35.693 --> 36:38.487
Arisu! Are you sure the answer is "Die"?

36:38.571 --> 36:40.406
- Please…
- Five…

36:42.241 --> 36:44.827
- Three. Two. One.
- This means it's correct, right?

36:47.955 --> 36:50.750
The time limit for this room
is one minute and thirty seconds.

36:50.833 --> 36:52.585
What's going on?

36:52.668 --> 36:53.961
Do you know which it is now?

36:55.004 --> 36:58.174
The length of a BMW 523d
is 4 meters and 94 centimeters.

36:58.257 --> 36:59.800
There was one parked outside here.

37:03.179 --> 37:05.723
The length of the building
is equivalent to four of those cars.

37:05.806 --> 37:08.476
This means that this building
is approximately 20 meters in length.

37:10.061 --> 37:12.855
My feet are 28 centimeters long.

37:12.939 --> 37:15.358
One, two, three…

37:17.610 --> 37:19.153
It should be around six meters.

37:20.446 --> 37:21.781
According to the evacuation map,

37:21.864 --> 37:23.824
the elevator is at the corner
of the building.

37:27.495 --> 37:29.622
The shape of the building is square.

37:30.206 --> 37:32.208
These rooms are all square-shaped too.

37:32.875 --> 37:34.919
Assuming that one side
of the building is 20 meters,

37:35.002 --> 37:38.214
and the rooms are 6 square meter in size,
there can only be three rooms on one side.

37:38.297 --> 37:41.008
- One minute remaining.
- Is there something I can write on?

37:41.092 --> 37:42.426
Here you go.

37:45.429 --> 37:46.973
Inside a square building,

37:47.056 --> 37:49.308
assuming that each room is square,

37:49.392 --> 37:51.018
this floor should have nine rooms.

37:51.102 --> 37:54.063
- It's just like a puzzle game.
- It's Arisu's forte!

37:54.146 --> 37:55.606
We started in this room.

37:56.357 --> 37:59.443
The high-school girl died in this room.
This is the next room.

38:00.069 --> 38:02.321
Thanks to Karube, we moved forward.

38:02.405 --> 38:05.116
This means that the door to the right
cannot be accessed.

38:05.199 --> 38:07.910
Then I opened the door to this room.

38:07.994 --> 38:08.995
Twenty seconds remaining.

38:09.078 --> 38:11.747
Through the process of elimination,
these two rooms are a no-go.

38:12.415 --> 38:13.332
I'm sure of it.

38:13.416 --> 38:14.667
Ten seconds remaining.

38:14.750 --> 38:17.044
The answer is "Die"!
The "Live" door is a trap!

38:17.628 --> 38:21.257
Four. Three. Two. One.

38:24.343 --> 38:28.180
The time limit for this room
is one minute and twenty seconds.

38:28.264 --> 38:30.182
If your reasoning works,
we'll be able to survive!

38:30.266 --> 38:31.809
You're awesome, Arisu!

38:32.435 --> 38:35.104
This game is not based on luck.
We can clear it together!

38:35.730 --> 38:38.232
According to my drawing,
the next is "Die" too.

38:39.191 --> 38:40.192
All right!

38:42.486 --> 38:43.529
Ready?

38:44.530 --> 38:45.781
Come on!

38:46.949 --> 38:48.659
All right!

38:49.785 --> 38:51.203
The time limit for this room…

38:51.287 --> 38:52.163
What's next?

38:52.246 --> 38:54.081
…is one minute and ten seconds.

38:56.625 --> 38:58.044
It's "Live."

39:01.088 --> 39:02.465
All right.

39:03.966 --> 39:04.842
Hey!

39:06.761 --> 39:07.803
Hey, it hurts!

39:08.304 --> 39:11.390
The time limit for this room
is one minute.

39:12.808 --> 39:14.060
There's no door in the front.

39:14.143 --> 39:16.270
All right!

39:16.354 --> 39:18.189
- That hurts!
- Take this!

39:19.648 --> 39:20.483
What's next?

39:28.407 --> 39:30.117
Since the right door
is out of the question,

39:30.201 --> 39:31.702
should we choose one on the outer wall?

39:34.080 --> 39:35.247
Wait!

39:36.290 --> 39:37.958
I might have missed something.

39:38.042 --> 39:39.293
Fifty seconds remaining.

39:42.338 --> 39:43.631
The room that we are currently in

39:43.714 --> 39:46.133
is in the back-left corner
of the building.

39:46.884 --> 39:49.512
The clear condition
is to leave this building.

39:50.221 --> 39:52.723
We're compelled to choose
the "Die" door, which leads us out.

39:52.807 --> 39:56.060
But if I recall, there is no gap
between this and the neighboring building.

39:56.143 --> 39:59.271
The "Live" door leads us
to where the high-school girl died.

39:59.855 --> 40:02.191
Why isn't there a door
to the rear of the building?

40:03.317 --> 40:05.945
I must have overlooked something.
What could that be?

40:06.529 --> 40:10.157
There's no space for any tricks
in the rooms we've come through.

40:10.241 --> 40:11.200
If that's the case…

40:16.205 --> 40:18.290
There's no time to waste! We'll die!

40:18.374 --> 40:21.460
- You didn't even open the door!
- You were the one who pushed it onto me!

40:21.544 --> 40:22.545
Give me a break!

40:23.087 --> 40:23.921
A video.

40:24.004 --> 40:24.964
Wait.

40:25.047 --> 40:27.174
Chota!
You took a video in the first room, right?

40:27.258 --> 40:28.926
We have no time for that!

40:29.552 --> 40:30.719
Thirty seconds remaining.

40:30.803 --> 40:32.096
I might have missed something.

40:32.179 --> 40:33.431
…some kind of event.

40:34.723 --> 40:35.766
Which do you think it is?

40:39.103 --> 40:40.312
Hey, look down!

40:40.896 --> 40:42.523
…will happen if the time is up?

40:42.606 --> 40:43.858
I can't stand it anymore!

40:49.989 --> 40:51.115
There's no door!

40:51.657 --> 40:53.367
There's no door in the room
the girl entered!

40:53.451 --> 40:55.035
- So what?
- There's a door here!

40:55.119 --> 40:56.454
- Ten seconds.
- This means…

40:57.163 --> 40:58.831
The room where the girl died isn't square!

40:58.914 --> 41:01.917
- Then this door…
- There's another room behind that door! 

41:02.001 --> 41:03.919
Four. Three.

41:04.003 --> 41:06.213
Two. One.

41:09.800 --> 41:12.470
The time limit for this room
is ten seconds.

41:13.012 --> 41:14.138
Ten seconds?

41:14.221 --> 41:15.431
Are you kidding me?

41:15.514 --> 41:17.308
It's not "Live." It's "Die"!

41:17.391 --> 41:19.101
Don't be tricked by the question!

41:19.185 --> 41:21.645
Five. Four.

41:21.729 --> 41:23.772
- Hurry up!
- Three. Two. One.

41:32.323 --> 41:33.866
Head downstairs!

41:38.329 --> 41:39.163
Hang in there!

41:55.387 --> 41:56.222
GAME CLEAR

41:56.305 --> 41:57.515
Congratulations.

42:02.019 --> 42:03.354
It's all thanks to you guys.

42:05.231 --> 42:06.565
Thank you.

42:12.154 --> 42:13.697
This must be retribution.

43:00.536 --> 43:04.039
To the survivors of the game,
we will now supply you with a visa.

43:04.123 --> 43:07.251
WE WILL SUPPLY ALL GAME SURVIVORS
WITH A THREE-DAY VISA

43:08.419 --> 43:09.420
Visa?

43:23.934 --> 43:26.854
I'm going to... drop out of the game!

43:29.648 --> 43:30.566
You guys.

43:31.150 --> 43:33.402
There's no end to this game,
no matter how much you clear.

43:37.072 --> 43:38.449
My visa ends today.

43:41.118 --> 43:42.286
Finally…

43:44.163 --> 43:45.956
This is the end.

43:55.507 --> 43:57.009
GM BUILDING

44:23.285 --> 44:24.745
When it's a new day,

44:25.621 --> 44:27.539
you'll die if your visa expires by then.

44:29.667 --> 44:32.252
Our visas will end too.

44:33.337 --> 44:34.338
Three more days.

44:35.297 --> 44:36.548
If you don't want to die,

44:37.591 --> 44:39.593
you'll have to keep playing the games.

47:32.182 --> 47:36.019
Subtitle translation by: Qianni Lu
